From: Ramprasad <ramprasadgoud34@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:40:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] feat(contracts): bank asset desk for auctions of
 repossessed items

English or sealed auctions among approved buyers, escrowed in mock rupee.
Nothing moves before the borrower's redemption window ends; the borrower can
pay dues and take the item back until then. Settlement re-attests value.
---
 contracts/src/assets/BankAssetDesk.sol | 363 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 363 insertions(+)
